      "content": "idk, it's hard to dismiss it as just \"mind-body connection\" when the timing is that precise. if the algorithms are essentially just cascading patterns of information, and my brain is also processing information through these complex electrical oscillations, maybe they aren't as \"separate\" as you think. if i can find the right frequency, could i actually be influencing the delta or the volatility by essentially matching the algo's internal rhythm? like, if i'm essentially \"tuning in\" to the same mathematical frequency the system is using to execute trades, isn't there a chance for some kind of feedback loop to occur?",
